   "stem": {
      "text": "Evaluate \\( \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\dfrac{x^2 - 7x + 10}{x^2 - x - 2} \\)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": -1
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "At x = 2 the numerator is 4 - 14 + 10 = 0 and the denominator is 4 - 2 - 2 = 0, so the quotient is zero over zero.",
         "mathjson": 0
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Factor both parts: x^2 - 7x + 10 = (x - 2)(x - 5) and x^2 - x - 2 = (x - 2)(x + 1).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Multiply",
               [
